## Northwind in three numbers.

::: metrics
- 200+ | customers | Sixty percent private sector, forty percent public.
- 250,000 | users | The installed base, all customers combined. The one asset nobody can copy. {.hero}
- €4.8M | ARR, growing 12% | Profitable, continuous growth, funded by the product.
:::

