## What I know, what I don't know yet.

::: compare
### What I know
- We acquire to build. The value of Contoso is the craft and the people.
- Team retention equals customer trust. Customers trust your teams; keeping them is serving them.
- With customers, we move at everyone's pace and honor every contract. A progressive integration.
- We become a platform organized by domains: Mail and Security, Collaboration, AI. It clarifies who does what.
- The executive committee is set. You know today who decides, and on what.

### What I don't know yet
- The fine detail of roles. It will settle over the coming weeks, by talking to people.
- There will be uneasy integration moments. Two cultures, a mail infrastructure and a SaaS.
- I don't promise every day will be smooth. I promise we'll do it with respect, on both sides.
:::
